{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/abd71d8b85262e55e8c99bfbce0beb53.avif?t=1759273079\" data-has-big width=1560 height=206 /></span><strong>A House of Lost Spirits. A Game of Power. An Unfolding Mystery. And a bunch of rats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are drawn to a lavish yet peculiar hotel by a cryptic telegram signed by one hundred rats: <strong>they need your help</strong>. Build a team of small but mighty rat companions, carefully craft multiple decks, and find powerful synergies to defeat the spectral inhabitants of this grand hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/6971f991a14ae61a87dc1a63471e299c.avif?t=1759273079\" data-has-big width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team of small but clever companions each maintains their own deck. Every turn, you draw one card from each companion's deck, then play these cards in strategic combinations to outmaneuver increasingly dangerous opponents.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, visit the  shop to acquire new cards for your companions or recruit new allies. Each addition opens up fresh tactical possibilities and unexpected synergies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/1fec2ab6069e9db45d96198d508d716e.poster.avif?t=1759273079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/1fec2ab6069e9db45d96198d508d716e.webm?t=1759273079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/1fec2ab6069e9db45d96198d508d716e.mp4?t=1759273079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/3da801eec27de2ed7e33bce00121fb1d.avif?t=1759273079\" data-has-big width=1560 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Companions -\u00a0</strong>Discover powerful synergies as companions interact and evolve together. Each companion has its own card pools, personality, and strengths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Multi-Deckbuilding -\u00a0</strong>Master the art of crafting and piloting 5 distinct companion decks simultaneously, each performing a unique function on your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/f8cf677c3f02295d00cc4fc2b888a6fb.poster.avif?t=1759273079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/f8cf677c3f02295d00cc4fc2b888a6fb.webm?t=1759273079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/f8cf677c3f02295d00cc4fc2b888a6fb.mp4?t=1759273079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-Reward Economy -\u00a0</strong>Our interest system and carefully tuned shop item costs create nail-biting decisions between immediate power and long-term gains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrade Paths -\u00a0</strong>Collect multiple copies of companions to unlock powerful evolutions, transforming their stats and abilities into devastating new forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/d3a22d086346cc62fa01ec91df59687d.poster.avif?t=1759273079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/d3a22d086346cc62fa01ec91df59687d.webm?t=1759273079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/d3a22d086346cc62fa01ec91df59687d.mp4?t=1759273079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/25dc2cdaf58b1d1e8478c7ae902ecf45.avif?t=1759273079\" data-has-big width=1560 height=206 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ unique companions each with 3 upgrade tiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ fully implemented cards\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique and randomized combat encounters\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ ascensions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931980/extras/cb599e22dd67bbe7ff2235e0539deb6b.avif?t=1759273079\" data-has-big width=1560 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're Go Face Games and this is our first indie title! Follow us on our journey by wishlisting and joining our Discord community!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.s